 Berhard and made a room for itself in the main board of Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange. In the year 2004, 50% of the share of UDA was acquired by Khazanah Nasional. It has many prestigious projects into its development list and some of the major ones are Kuala Lumpur bus terminal Hentian Puduraya, the Tapah Prison complex and Angkasa Impian 2 Condominium.\n\n## Common facilities\n\nImage: security-access-control-o24-hour security  | Image: basketball-oBasketball court\nImage: bbq-oBBQ  | Image: parking-oCovered car park\nImage: gym-oGym  | Image: run-oJogging track\nImage: washer-oLaundry  | Image: lounge-oLounge\nImage: asterisk-oPerimeter Fencing  | Image: playground-oPlayground\nImage: reflexology-oReflexology Path  | Image: sauna-oSauna\nImage: swim-oSwimming pool\n\n## Building details\n\nBuilding  | # Floors  | # Units\n--- | --- | ---\nSinaran TTDI  | 30  | 249\n\n## FAQs\n\n##### What are the selling prices in Sinaran TTDI?\n\nSelling prices in Sinaran TTDI start from RM 850,000.\n\n##### What is the PSF for Sinaran TTDI?\n\nThe current PSF range in Sinaran TTDI start from RM 703.\n\n##### What are the rental prices in Sinaran TTDI?\n\nRental prices in Sinaran TTDI start from RM 3,600.\n\n##### How many floors are there in Sinaran TTDI?\n\nSinaran TTDI has 30 floors.\n\n##### What is the address of Sinaran TTDI?\n\nSinaran TTDI is located at Jalan Tun Mohd Fuad 3, Kuala Lumpur.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSinaran TTDI - Kondominium untuk Dijual atau Sewa | PropertyGuru Malaysia (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/bm/kondo/sinaran-ttdi-310)\nciteturn133search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago;   * ### What are the sale prices of units in Sinaran TTDI? ...   * ### What is the average rent at Sinaran TTDI?\n\n# Sinaran TTDI\n\n  * Kondominium\n\nJulat Harga Jualan\n\nRM 850,000 ~  RM 1,300,000\n\njulat harga sewa\n\nRM 3,600 ~  RM 4,500\n\nSinaran TTDI\n\nJalan Tun Mohd Fuad 3, 60000, Kuala Lumpur\n\n##### Ke